WEBVTT

00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:30.901
However, for a long time,

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:33.812
the chicken’s revered status 
continued to exist

00:02:33.812 --> 00:02:36.264
alongside its culinary one.

00:02:36.264 --> 00:02:38.305
The Ancient Greeks used fighting roosters

00:02:38.305 --> 00:02:41.866
as inspirational examples 
for young soldiers.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:45.218
The Romans consulted chickens as oracles.

00:02:45.218 --> 00:02:47.281
And as late as the 7th Century,

00:02:47.281 --> 00:02:50.837
the chicken was considered
a symbol for Christianity.

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.602
Over the next few centuries,

00:02:52.602 --> 00:02:54.945
chickens accompanied humans
wherever they went,

00:02:54.945 --> 00:02:57.109
spreading throughout the world
through trade,

00:02:57.109 --> 00:02:57.991
conquest,

00:02:57.991 --> 00:02:59.844
and colonization.

00:02:59.844 --> 00:03:01.356
After the Opium Wars,